Bombay Sketchbook — third-party material in these reels

Voice     Microsoft Edge neural voices hi-IN-SwaraNeural and hi-IN-MadhurNeural, through edge-tts
          (https://github.com/rany2/edge-tts). Online service; check Microsoft's terms before commercial use,
          or replace voice/<reel>/l0..l6.wav with your own recording and rebuild.
Fonts     Caveat (Impallari Type), Kalam (Indian Type Foundry), Reenie Beanie (James Grieshaber) — SIL Open Font
          License 1.1, from https://github.com/google/fonts
Music     Original score, synthesised in mix.py (plucked strings by physical modelling, hand drums, flute and drone
          by synthesis). No samples, no recordings.
Sound     Procedural foley (pen, brush, marker, stamp, room and street tone), synthesised in mix.py.
Pictures  All drawings are generated by code in icons.js / index.html. No stock images, no logos.
Tools     Lemo-Opuscar library (https://github.com/lemomo-ai/lemo-opuscar) for rendering and audio helpers.
Names     Shopify, WooCommerce, WordPress, Amazon, Flipkart, Myntra, Blinkit, Zepto, Swiggy Instamart, Meta, Google,
          Razorpay, Instagram and Facebook are named as the platforms the studio works on; no marks are drawn.
          The round "Bombay Marketing" stamp is a drawn stand-in, not the studio's logo.
